# Workshop "Agent Orchestration with Claude"

**English** · [Português](README.pt.md) · [हिन्दी](README.hi.md) · [עברית](README.he.md)

Workshop kit: the one-command setup, the skills and agents, the cost hooks, the statusline, the orchestrator and the hands-on projects (the Security Arena and the practice project). Kit version: **{{WORKSHOP_VERSION}}**.

## Install (participants)

You need an account on the [Anthropic Console]({{CONSOLE_URL}}) with credits. You don't need admin rights.

**macOS** (Terminal):

```bash
{{ONE_LINER_MAC}}
```

**Windows** (PowerShell):

```powershell
{{ONE_LINER_WINDOWS}}
```

The setup takes 10 to 20 minutes. If it stops halfway, run the same command again: finished steps are skipped. Full guide, with the pre-work: [docs/INSTALL.md](docs/INSTALL.md).

